<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 257-7 INNINGS CLOSED V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 257-7 INNINGS CLOSED V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan scored 257 for seven in 50 overs against West Indies in their World Series limited overs match at the WACA ground on Friday.</p>
<p>Score: Pakistan 257-7 in 50 overs (Ijaz Ahmed 94, Mohammad Wasim 53) v West Indies.</p>
